d 'XPROJ': module to create, manage and build research project in Stata
d
d  xproj creates project directory structures with configurable
d subdirectories and an optional README file. It maintains a
d persistent lookup table associating project names with directory
d paths and optional notes. Subcommands allow users to register
d existing directories, list projects, change the working directory
d to a selected project, and remove entries from the lookup table
d without deleting project files. The make subcommand uses xdtree
d to display the created directory structure unless that display is
d disabled. 
d
d KW: project
d KW: directory
d KW: workflow
d
d Requires: Stata version 14 and xdtree from SSC (q.vb.)
d
d Distribution-Date: 20261116
d
d Author: Yongyi Zeng,  School of Management, Xiamen University, China
